- \`glittery + 抽象名詞\` 比喻光鮮亮麗，常帶一點「表面風光」的語氣
  - *a glittery career*

**Related phrases**：glitter（閃爍） · all that glitters is not gold

*Saved 10/05 · Generated by AI 10/02*"
`;

